:1rem;}.wsp-related-card{background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;}.wsp-related-card a{font-weight:700;color:var(--global-palette1, #3182CE);text-decoration:none;}.wsp-related-card a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}.wsp-related-card p{margin:.35rem 0 0;font-size:.9rem;color:#555;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call{background:#E0A83C !important;border:2px solid #E0A83C !important;color:#16203A !important;font-size:1.25rem !important;font-weight:800 !important;padding:1rem 2.2rem !important;border-radius:40px !important;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(224,168,60,.25),0 8px 26px rgba(224,168,60,.5) !important;text-shadow:none !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call strong{color:#16203A !important;}.wsp-hero a.wsp-btn-call:hover{background:#fff !important;border-color:#fff !important;}</style><div class='wsp-hero'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Oklahoma Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: Rules for Selling a Rental</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Oklahoma</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Oklahoma Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Oklahoma Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights sale</li><li>Turn the Oklahoma Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Oklahoma House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Oklahoma statutes set the basic rules between landlords and tenants, including deposits, notices and what happens when a rental is sold.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Landlord must return the balance of the deposit, without interest, within forty-five (45) days after termination of tenancy, delivery of possession and written demand by the tenant; itemized written statement by mail or in person. (41 O.S. \u00a7 115(B); <a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/OK_Statutes/CompleteTitles/os41.pdf?section=41-115' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>If tenant makes no written demand within six months after termination, the deposit reverts to the landlord. (41 O.S. \u00a7 115(B); <a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/OK_Statutes/CompleteTitles/os41.pdf?section=41-115' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>On cessation of landlord&#x27;s interest (including sale), the deposit holder must within a reasonable time transfer deposits to the successor and notify tenants in writing (or return them). (41 O.S. \u00a7 115(C); <a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/OK_Statutes/CompleteTitles/os41.pdf?section=41-115' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord must give at least one (1) day&#x27;s notice of intent to enter (except emergency/impracticable) and enter only at reasonable times. (41 O.S. \u00a7 128; <a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/OK_Statutes/CompleteTitles/os41.pdf?section=41-128' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Landlord must make all repairs and do whatever is necessary to keep the dwelling unit and premises fit and habitable, and maintain electrical, plumbing, heating and other facilities. (41 O.S. \u00a7 118(A); <a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/OK_Statutes/CompleteTitles/os41.pdf?section=41-118' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li></ul><div class=\"chb-cta\" style=\"margin:32px 0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(120deg,#0F1C2E 0%,#16293F 100%);padding:28px 32px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#fff;\"><div style=\"max-width:600px;\"><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;color:#E0A83C;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:6px;\">Selling in Oklahoma?</div><div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:20px;line-height:1.35;color:#fff;\">We buy Oklahoma houses as-is, with no commission, no repairs and no closing costs to you.</div></div><a href=\"#\" onclick=\"var f=document.querySelector('iframe[data-form-id]');if(f){f.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'center'});return false;}\" style=\"flex-shrink:0;padding:14px 24px;border-radius:8px;background:#E0A83C;color:#16203A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;\">Get My Cash Offer &rarr;</a></div><div class='wsp-related'><div class='wsp-related-grid'><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/oklahoma-eviction-notice/'>Oklahoma Eviction Notice: Types and Days</a><p>Official sources.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/oklahoma-guides-by-city-and-county/'>Oklahoma guides by city and county</a><p>Every local guide we publish.</p></div><div class='wsp-related-card'><a href='https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-oklahoma/'>We buy houses in Oklahoma</a><p>How a cash offer works.</p></div></div></div><h2>Sources</h2><ul><li><a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/OK_Statutes/CompleteTitles/os41.pdf?section=41-115' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>41 O.S. \u00a7 115(B)</a></li><li><a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/OK_Statutes/CompleteTitles/os41.pdf?section=41-128' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>41 O.S. \u00a7 128</a></li><li><a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/OK_Statutes/CompleteTitles/os41.pdf?section=41-118' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>41 O.S. \u00a7 118(A)</a></li></ul><p><em>General information for Oklahoma Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights, not legal or tax advice. Confirm details with the official office or a licensed professional.</em></p><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Oklahoma\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/we-buy-houses-in-oklahoma/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Oklahoma Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights\", \"item\": \"https://cashhomebuyersca.com/oklahoma-landlord-tenant-law-tenant-rights/\"}]}</script></div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->", "status": "publish", "rank_math_title": "Oklahoma Landlord Tenant Law and Tenant Rights", "rank_math_description": "Oklahoma landlord tenant law and tenant rights: deposits, notices, entry and selling a rented house. Official sources only.", "rank_math_focus_keyword": "oklahoma tenant rights"}, {"slug": "oklahoma-eviction-notice", "title": "Oklahoma Eviction Notice Rules: Notice Types, Days and Selling the House", "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<style>.wsp-hero{position:relative;margin:0 calc(-50vw + 50%);padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-image:none;background:linear-gradient(170deg,#12293f 0%,#0c1c2e 46%,#060c16 100%);overflow:hidden;}.wsp-hero-inner{max-width:1216px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 1fr;gap:2.5rem;align-items:center;}.wsp-hero-left{text-align:center;}.wsp-hero-left h1{color:#fff;font-size:2.6rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 1rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-hero-left h2{color:#fff;font-weight:300;font-size:1.3rem;margin:0 0 1rem;text-shadow:1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.3);}.wsp-hero-left p{color:#fff;font-size:1rem;font-weight:300;max-width:5