o'><div class='wsp-hero-inner'><div class='wsp-hero-left'><h1>Oklahoma Eviction Notice Rules: Notice Types, Days and Selling the House</h1><div class=wsp-kicker>Cash Home Buyers in Oklahoma</div><div class=wsp-speed><span>Cash Offer in 24 Hours</span></div><ul class=wsp-checks><li>Oklahoma Eviction Notice Rules: inherited, behind on payments, tenants or repairs, we buy the house as-is</li><li>No fees, commissions or closing costs on a Oklahoma Eviction Notice Rules sale</li><li>Turn the Oklahoma Eviction Notice Rules offer down and you owe us nothing</li></ul><h2>Selling a Oklahoma House? Get a Cash Offer</h2><p>We buy as-is.</p><p><a class='wsp-btn-outline wsp-btn-call' href='tel:424-435-2326'>Call or Text <strong>&nbsp;(424) 435-2326</strong></a></p></div><div class='wsp-hero-right'><iframe src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/widget/form/zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' data-form-id='zKzKbSeB3aqwWwE8NNxO' title='Cash Offer Form'></iframe><br /><script src='https://connect.cashhomebuyersca.com/js/form_embed.js' async></script></div></div></div><div class='wsp-wrap'><p><em>Last updated November 14, 2026.</em></p><p><strong>Oklahoma law requires a landlord to give a specific written notice before filing an eviction, and the number of days depends on the reason.</strong></p><h2>What the official sources say</h2><ul><li>Nonpayment: landlord may terminate if tenant fails to pay within five (5) days after written notice of demand; demand for rent is deemed a demand for possession, no further notice to quit needed. (41 O.S. \u00a7 131(B); <a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/OK_Statutes/CompleteTitles/os41.pdf?section=41-131' target='_blank' rel='noreferrer noopener nofollow'>source</a>)</li><li>Material noncompliance (lease violation): written notice that the agreement will terminate not less than 15 days after receipt unless remedied within 10 days. (41 O.S. \u00a7 132(B); <a href='https://www.oklegislature.gov/OK_Statutes/CompleteTitles/os41.pdf?section=41-132' target='_b